  "body": "If you've been searching for an easy care home in a location that lets you leave the car behind, this is the opportunity you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned on a flat freehold site in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this immaculately presented home offers the ideal blend of comfort, convenience and relaxed coastal living. Just a short, easy stroll from Orewa Beach, cafés, restaurants and the vibrant town centre, you'll love the lifestyle this address provides.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless everyday living, the thoughtfully planned layout features light filled open plan living, dining and kitchen areas that flow seamlessly to a sunny outdoor entertaining space. Three generous bedrooms are complemented by a full bathroom, a second separate toilet, internal access garaging and excellent off street parking.\r\n\r\nThe low maintenance gardens have been beautifully cared for, allowing you to spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying everything this sought after coastal community has to offer.\r\n\r\nWhether you're downsizing, retiring, investing or simply looking for a home where convenience and lifestyle go hand in hand, this property is sure to impress.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a home in such a tightly held location are always in demand. We encourage your early inspection.\r\n\r\nContact us today or visit one of our scheduled open homes, we look forward to welcoming you.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
